<title>USA: Ramsay Managed Care Q4, fiscal yr results.</title>
<headline>Ramsay Managed Care Q4, fiscal yr results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.81     loss	 $0.31</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,591     loss	 1,481</p>
<p> Revs			 5,853		    4,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,387		    4,804</p>
<p>	  FISCAL YEAR ENDED JUNE 30</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.12     loss	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net loss		  13,494     loss	 1,571</p>
<p> Revs			21,602		   16,145</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,378		    3,789</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Ramsay Managed Care Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said results for the year were impacted by a one-time non-cash pretax charge against earnings of $2.7 million for write-offs in the fourth quarter and in addition the establishment of a $4.9 million reserve with respect to the company's investment in its health maintenance organization operations.</p>
